Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Test Plugins|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|test-dependency-able-portlet,test-dependency-baker-portlet,test-dependency-charlie-portlet,test-dependency-dog-portlet,test-dependency-easy-portlet|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG

Scenario: View Dependency Able Fox
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Test Dependency Page|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Test Dependency Able|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Dependency Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Test Dependency Baker|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Dependency Page|
	And Portlet add PG
